{"conclusion":"漏译武器信息：源串 wielding a massive battle-axe and clad in heavy armor 含两项装备描述，译文「一位身穿重甲的精神体战士」只保留重甲，丢掉「手持巨型战斧」。补查：组件 mod-tome，源码 game/modules/tome/data/talents/psionic/thought-forms.lua（commit 624a67329fe2a","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"9ec39e18137f4e690906810b4a9f0860c4cc1cd55ec2bad46d2037700ccadb5d","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"漏译武器信息：源串 wielding a massive battle-axe and clad in heavy armor 含两项装备描述，译文「一位身穿重甲的精神体战士」只保留重甲，丢掉「手持巨型战斧」。补查：组件 mod-tome，源码 game/modules/tome/data/talents/psionic/thought-forms.lua（commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63）第 297-300 行，thought-forged warrior 的 desc 与第 399-402 行 thought-forged defender 的 desc 同构；本仓 mod-tome.lua:28022 对 defender 译出「他手持剑盾」，而 mod-tome.lua:28014 的 warrior 无对应武器短语，构成同族条目的漏译与跨条不一致。","sha256":"cba267e45c600636c1ca3036ec46ec30fded4c7e5e3b891191d0b72207d232f9"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"bb8fa3ffab3ee22756107de15c66c4c82f7c54d9d037fc6a3d7a16230272805b","observation_sha256":"cba267e45c600636c1ca3036ec46ec30fded4c7e5e3b891191d0b72207d232f9","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
{"conclusion":"触发条件被改成伤害类型，且 crazed 误译为「邪恶」。源串 Each time that you take damage from a spell 指「受到由法术造成的伤害」（任意伤害类型），译文「每当你受到魔法伤害」在本地化语境中读作某一伤害类型；本仓 mod-tome.lua:24901（Nature's Defiance）对完全相同的 any time you take damage f","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"a2671f766e603a6ad25b3b19fd21c72ca9d280ecaf2af4ae2b8fc52ccee73634","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"触发条件被改成伤害类型，且 crazed 误译为「邪恶」。源串 Each time that you take damage from a spell 指「受到由法术造成的伤害」（任意伤害类型），译文「每当你受到魔法伤害」在本地化语境中读作某一伤害类型；本仓 mod-tome.lua:24901（Nature's Defiance）对完全相同的 any time you take damage from a spell 译为「每次你受到法术伤害时」，属跨条不一致。另 crazed arcane users 译为「邪恶魔法师」，crazed 为「疯狂/癫狂」而非「邪恶」。补查：组件 mod-tome，源码 game/modules/tome/data/talents/uber/wil.lua（commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63）第 238-258 行 Spell Feedback，trigger(self, t, target, source_t) 由施法事件调用，内部 DamageType.MIND.projector 造成精神伤害并按 target:getTalentCooldown(source_t) 设置 EFF_SPELL_FEEDBACK，证明触发条件是「法术来源」而非奥术/魔法伤害类型（该版本 arcane 的既有译名见 mod-tome.lua:6836「奥术」）。","sha256":"dbfd7244e9135f3da0cabc73c93ad05b8332274553fa3a6266e3fe528bf0642a"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"fe7ba2e382ad097de03ebf882af5205123dbcfb4b00d090a21a6062e808efec3","observation_sha256":"dbfd7244e9135f3da0cabc73c93ad05b8332274553fa3a6266e3fe528bf0642a","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
{"conclusion":"伤害口径译错：源串 Hit your target with your shield 3 times for %d%% damage 的 %d%% 来自盾牌，译文作「造成 %d%% 武器伤害」。补查：组件 mod-tome，源码 game/modules/tome/data/talents/techniques/weaponshield.lua（commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5","disposition":"confirmed","entry_revision_identity":"a2a5827da94208dfc76b4e720052751ec62d4db1b9feb1fafdbb127d3f708500","evidence_commit":null,"evidence_path":null,"evidence_snapshot":{"content":"伤害口径译错：源串 Hit your target with your shield 3 times for %d%% damage 的 %d%% 来自盾牌，译文作「造成 %d%% 武器伤害」。补查：组件 mod-tome，源码 game/modules/tome/data/talents/techniques/weaponshield.lua（commit 624a67329fe2ad440c5b344785a9c73fcf22ae63）第 109-137 行 Shield Slam，getShieldDamage 用 combatTalentWeaponDamage 配合 T_SHIELD_EXPERTISE，action 中三次 self:attackTargetWith(target, shield_combat, nil, damage) 均以 hasShield() 返回的 shield_combat 结算，即盾牌伤害而非主手武器伤害；本仓同族盾系技能 mod-tome.lua:31183、31217 对同形 %d%% damage 均译「盾牌伤害」，此条构成机制误述兼跨条不一致。","sha256":"f4a41af52354eaa71081fc4eae94ec8751666a796e41ec2e175e7cc88e41df12"},"observation_contract":"translation_contextual_v2","observation_identity":"a93097c31b0b0572f63c0eb4e57ab2b272a024a900ba05443b34bd2d2eacf762","observation_sha256":"f4a41af52354eaa71081fc4eae94ec8751666a796e41ec2e175e7cc88e41df12","repair_required":true,"schema_version":1}
